=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the {p:Mithran Bivouac} in {z:Meriphataud Mountains (S)} (I-8) for another {k:Poet god's key}.
* Head to the **Collapsing Floor** at the top of {z:Castle Oztroja (S)} for a cutscene.
* Examine the **Collapsing Floor** again to enter a BCNM. Your buffs will still be on.
* This fight is against {p:Fenrir}.
** {p:Fenrir} will transform into {n:Karaha-Baruha} and {n:Robel-Akbel} and back throughout the fight.
** {n:Lehko Habhoka} will assist you in this fight and must be kept alive.
* Return to the {p:Mithran Bivouac} in {z:Meriphataud Mountains (S)} (I-8) for a cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Dhea Prandoleh} ({z:Windurst Waters (S)} (H-10)) for a cutscene.
* Examine the **Sealed Entrance** at (F-10) in {z:West Sarutabaruta (S)}.
* Return to {z:Windurst Waters (S)} to complete the quest.
** Speak to {p:Romaa Mihgo|Romaa Mihgo (S)} in {z:Windurst Waters (S)} at (G-11) to learn {p:Trust Magic|Trust}: {p:Romaa Mihgo|BGWiki:Trusts} if you possess the {@k} {k:Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls}.

If you are working on missions then return to {M:Adieu, Lilisette|Adieu, Lilisette|Adieu, Lilisette}.
